=2 Walkthrough
* You cannot start this quest if you have another {q:Weapon Skill Quest|WSNM|Weapon Skill Quest} active. You must return to the person that gave said quest and quit it to start another.

* Speaking with {p:Perih Vashai} will grant you the key item {k:Weapons Training Guide|Weapon training guide} as well as the {p:Bow of Trials}. You will need to break the latent on the {p:Bow of Trials} before completing the rest of the quest.

:* Breaking the Latent

::* With the {p:Bow of Trials} equipped in your Main hand, fight experience-yielding mobs ("Incredibly Easy Prey" or higher) and perform {p:Weapon Skills|Category:Weapon Skills} or close {p:Skillchains|Category:Skillchain} to accumulate 300 "Trial Points".

|^Skillchain Level|Points
|No Skillchain|5
|Level 1|7
|Level 2|9
|Level 3|11

::* You know you have enough points when the latent breaks. You will know it is done when the weapon's elemental resistances disappear from your active resistances (colored dots below the gear grid, but above the selected item description). **The item's description text will never change**.

!Broken Latent.png||
* Trade the {p:Bow of Trials} back to {p:Perih Vashai}. This will give you the key item {k:Map to the Annals of Truth}. You will be instructed to travel to {z:Cape Teriggan}.

* Take {i:Silent Oil|Silent Oil|4165} and {i:Prism Powder|Prism Powder|4164} with you and head to {z:Kuftal Tunnel}. Travel to (I-7) and north through the tunnel. Continue north; take no branches. At (I-4) the tunnel will loop down southward into a larger space, and you will need to curve immediately back up to the northwest. Exit {z:Kuftal Tunnel} into {z:Cape Teriggan}.
** Faster traveling options:
*** You can also use the Home Point to the {z:Cloister of Gales} at (F-5) (which is closer to the quest spot).
*** Or the Survival Guide located at the Outpost at (G-8).
*** Or the {p:Unity Warp} to {z:Cape Teriggan} (Level 128) bring you to (H-7).

* Once you are at the Cape, travel to (G-7). This is where you will find the ??? to spawn the NM.

* This fight is against {m:Stolas}, a Bird. It is weak to {p:Ice}. Once you kill it, re-examine the ??? to receive the key item {k:Annals of Truth}.

* Go back and speak with {p:Perih Vashai} to receive your reward.

